          "text": "PI Kung-ch'ên 畢拱辰 (T. 星伯, H. 湖目, 羼提居士), d. Mar. 16, 1644, was a native of Yeh-hsien, Shantung. He obtained the chin-shih degree in 1616, and two years later was appointed magistrate of Yen-ch'êng, Kiangsu.",
